#
# Counter-example for the `math:` expression lowering
# (crates/logic/src/physical/lower.rs, MathLoweringError::ArgumentSlotMissingIndex): a
# math:ApplicationExpression root whose one math:ArgumentSlot names a
# math:slotExpression but no math:slotIndex at all. Distinct from
# tests/counter-examples/argument-slot-malformed.ttl (a standalone, unreferenced
# math:ArgumentSlot authored purely to trip the SHACL shape): THIS fixture wires the
# malformed slot under a real math:ApplicationExpression root, so the native lowering
# actually reaches and rejects it (the standalone SHACL-only fixture is never picked up
# as an expression root or slot child, so it never reaches
# crates/logic/src/physical/lower.rs at all). The authored math:structuralKey lets the
# reasoned-graph gate (check_structural_key_on_rejected_expression) also reach it.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:root a math:ApplicationExpression ;
    math:operator ex:op ;
    math:argumentSlot ex:slot0 ;
    math:structuralKey "not-a-real-digest" .

ex:slot0 a math:ArgumentSlot ;
    math:slotExpression ex:operand .

ex:operand a math:NumberLiteral ;
    math:literalValue 1 .
